==History==
2025
*The Boss Bandit card was added to the game on 7/4/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/4/2025)|April 2025 Update]].
*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Boss Bandit's hitpoints by 3%.
*On 8/7/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/7/2025)|Balance Update]], changed the way the Getaway Grenade operates. The Getaway Grenade can be activated a total of 2 times independent on Boss Bandit's hitpoints, with a 3-second cooldown between its uses. The same update also decreased the Boss Bandit's hitpoints by 4%.
*On 12/1/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Boss Bandit's damage and dash damage by 9%, and increased it's attack speed to 1.1 (from 1.2)

